  "features": [
    "Independent event-loop-delay histogram state, resolutions and native timer records.",
    "Passive weak histogram handles, collected-record sweep and VM/isolation/worker shutdown cleanup.",
    "Actual elapsed interval sampling starts on enable and samples persist across disable/re-enable.",
